  31:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_eth.c ****           (##) Initialize the related GPIO clocks
  32:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_eth.c ****           (##) Configure Ethernet pin-out
  33:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_eth.c ****           (##) Configure Ethernet NVIC interrupt (IT mode)   
  34:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_eth.c ****     
  35:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_eth.c ****       (#)Initialize Ethernet DMA Descriptors in chain mode and point to allocated buffers:
  36:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_eth.c ****           (##) HAL_ETH_DMATxDescListInit(); for Transmission process
  37:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_eth.c ****           (##) HAL_ETH_DMARxDescListInit(); for Reception process
  38:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_eth.c **** 
  39:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_eth.c ****       (#)Enable MAC and DMA transmission and reception:
  40:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_eth.c ****           (##) HAL_ETH_Start();
  41:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_eth.c **** 
  42:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_eth.c ****       (#)Prepare ETH DMA TX Descriptors and give the hand to ETH DMA to transfer 
  43:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_eth.c ****          the frame to MAC TX FIFO:
  44:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_eth.c ****          (##) HAL_ETH_TransmitFrame();
  45:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_eth.c **** 
  46:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_eth.c ****       (#)Poll for a received frame in ETH RX DMA Descriptors and get received 
  47:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_eth.c ****          frame parameters
  48:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_eth.c ****          (##) HAL_ETH_GetReceivedFrame(); (should be called into an infinite loop)
  49:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_eth.c **** 
  50:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_eth.c ****       (#) Get a received frame when an ETH RX interrupt occurs:
  51:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_eth.c ****          (##) HAL_ETH_GetReceivedFrame_IT(); (called in IT mode only)
  52:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_eth.c **** 
  53:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_eth.c ****       (#) Communicate with external PHY device:
  54:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_eth.c ****          (##) Read a specific register from the PHY  
  55:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_eth.c ****               HAL_ETH_ReadPHYRegister();
  56:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_eth.c ****          (##) Write data to a specific RHY register:
  57:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_eth.c ****               HAL_ETH_WritePHYRegister();
  58:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_eth.c **** 
  59:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_eth.c ****       (#) Configure the Ethernet MAC after ETH peripheral initialization
  60:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_eth.c ****           HAL_ETH_ConfigMAC(); all MAC parameters should be filled.
